WEBVTT

00:00:00.688 --> 00:00:05.158
A flood can disappear while its economic effects remain Explore road

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:09.320
damage repair costs and recovery across a small town Choose

00:00:09.212 --> 00:00:12.245
a rise above the stream banks then run the flood

00:00:12.525 --> 00:00:16.308
Watch water reach connected low streets while higher roads may

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:21.145
stay dry After drainage red roads still need work Select

00:00:21.038 --> 00:00:25.495
one to inspect its local depth damage fraction and contribution

00:00:25.375 --> 00:00:28.508
to the repair bill The Curves tab links depth with

00:00:28.388 --> 00:00:32.320
damage and shows recovery through time Repair jobs let you

00:00:32.212 --> 00:00:36.570
see which sections are waiting underway or finished Change the

00:00:36.462 --> 00:00:40.270
number of crews play recovery or move the day slider

00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:44.832
Watch crews work and residents return More crews can finish

00:00:44.725 --> 00:00:49.358
sooner without changing the original damage bill These are simplified

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:54.395
estimates Your challenge distinguish what controls damage from what controls

00:00:54.275 --> 00:00:58.295
recovery The interactive guide helps you find each control
